  "description": "Decomposition Planning and Roadmap workflow skill. Use this skill when the user needs Creates step-by-step decomposition plans and migration roadmaps for breaking apart monolithic applications. Use when asking \\\"what order should I extract services?\\\", \\\"plan my migration\\\", \\\"create a decomposition roadmap\\\", \\\"prioritize what to split\\\", \\\"monolith to microservices strategy\\\", or tracking decomposition progress. Do NOT use for domain analysis (use domain-analysis) or component sizing (use component-identification-sizing) and the operator should preserve the upstream workflow, copied support files, and provenance before merging or handing off.",
